OL,3,GNEWSAStatue plan for Black Country glam
OL,4,Arockers Slade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create a statue celebrating
OL,7,Fone of the UK's most loved bands have
OL,8,Fbeen unveiled.
OL,10,FA 3m (9.8ft) statue of rock band Slade
OL,11,Faims to reflect how big they were in
OL,12,Ftheir heyday and their influence on the
OL,13,Fmusic industry.
OL,15,F"They were always very proud of being
OL,16,Ffrom Wolverhampton, so it's about time
OL,17,FWolverhampton shows it's proud of Slade
OL,18,Fas well," Phil Dan, from the city's
OL,19,FMusic Heritage organisation, said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
