OL,3,GNEWSAStatue plan for Black Country glam
OL,4,Arockers Slade
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Luke Perry, who designed the
OL,7,Fstatue, said he incorporated their
OL,8,Fcelebrated top hats and flares into the
OL,9,Fstatue so people could instantly think
OL,10,F"music and glam-rock". Since forming in
OL,11,F1963, Slade achieved worldwide success
OL,12,Fwith 17 consecutive Top 20 hits.
